{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object seen, move to object and take it. If object heavy, call for help. Perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CallForHelp    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    />",
